    "actions": [],
    "description": "<p>An EVA suit is an unarmored voidsuit and provides bare minimum life support and environmental isolative features to ensure the wearer can survive in a vacuum for a limited time. It prevents Exposure as a result of being out in the void of space, and in combination with a Sealed Air Supply (@UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-gear.HYpypVyGlwJ2agae]{Sealed Air Supply}), can keep a character alive in extreme environments.</p><p>The user has +30% RES and takes -5% less Special-Category damage.</p>",
